Individual humans are time itself, 
Driven by the ego.
every possible individual outcome 
of humanity at that possible moment 
sustainable by life, exists and 
interacts together at the same time.
progression is coded in our DNA.  
We must progress, evolve, and adapt, 
or we will die.
we are the culmination of 
the evolutionary form
of that accidental shift that 
suddenly held the universe.
our universal event horizon is
our cell wall where another
universe lies adjacent. 